join detective right
detective: Aslan thinks you poisoned Dracula, and that's why he collapsed at the dinner table.
join cook left
cook: Why would I do that? Sounds like a stupid idea.
detective: You did mention that you don't like vampires.
cook (unamused): Yeah, I did. But only a child would let that sort of thing come in the way of their basic sense of morality.
cook (speaking): I didn't poison him.
